# Links lychee should not try to resolve.

# The raw install/uninstall script URLs point at the `main` branch of the
# canonical repo; on a feature branch or a fork before the scripts are published
# there they 404, which is expected and not a real broken link.
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/j-pfalzgraf/coffeebreak/main/install.sh
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/j-pfalzgraf/coffeebreak/main/install.ps1
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/j-pfalzgraf/coffeebreak/main/uninstall.sh

# The Homebrew tap and crates.io page may not exist yet for a fresh fork.
https://github.com/j-pfalzgraf/coffeebreak/releases
